cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ephys-prep
abstract: 'Prepares raw extracellular recordings (Neuropixels and other probes) for spike sorting with SpikeInterface, following
  the AIND and IBL pipelines: time window on the session clock, phase-shift correction, high-pass filter, bad-channel detection,
  common median reference or IBL destriping, and DREDge drift estimation, with QC figures. Part of the Pennsieve systems neuroscience
  workflows.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
